From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: robyroro <41092915+robyroro@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 10 Oct 2026 09:53:26 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] mini_installer: pack Shade's filter lists beside the browser

The blocking engine reads EasyList and EasyPrivacy from blocking\ in the
version directory (base::DIR_ASSETS). //ghost/components/blocking:filter_lists
copies them beside the binaries; chrome.release puts them in the installer,
and the archiving action depends on the copy so it never packs a build
without them. They stay separate data files, never compiled into a binary,
as their licenses ask.

Why: the installer packs only the files chrome.release names.
Upstream: not upstreamable: product-specific data
Signed-off-by: robyroro <41092915+robyroro@users.noreply.github.com>

diff --git a/chrome/installer/mini_installer/BUILD.gn b/chrome/installer/mini_installer/BUILD.gn
index ce1f5a5711eeba1109bef0169a80cbe29373a843..46c8a5ac28b9b3e64480bddb9a0bebd23d713fd3 100644
--- a/chrome/installer/mini_installer/BUILD.gn
+++ b/chrome/installer/mini_installer/BUILD.gn
@@ -197,6 +197,7 @@ action("mini_installer_archive") {
     "//chrome/chrome_elf",
     "//chrome/common/win:eventlog_provider",
     "//chrome/installer/setup",
+    "//ghost/components/blocking:filter_lists",
     "//third_party/icu:icudata",
   ]
 
diff --git a/chrome/installer/mini_installer/chrome.release b/chrome/installer/mini_installer/chrome.release
index cf4c3fa1816ed500b7f2168abc105fcec5f18a84..e84916d91715c61771f37d0db8a32fa897d36f6b 100644
--- a/chrome/installer/mini_installer/chrome.release
+++ b/chrome/installer/mini_installer/chrome.release
@@ -68,6 +68,13 @@ MEIPreload\preloaded_data.pb: %(VersionDir)s\MEIPreload\
 # IWA Key Distribution
 #
 IwaKeyDistribution\iwa-key-distribution.pb: %(VersionDir)s\IwaKeyDistribution\
+
+#
+# Shade's filter lists: //ghost/components/blocking/data, copied beside the
+# binaries by //ghost/components/blocking:filter_lists.
+#
+blocking\easylist.txt: %(VersionDir)s\blocking\
+blocking\easyprivacy.txt: %(VersionDir)s\blocking\
 IwaKeyDistribution\manifest.json: %(VersionDir)s\IwaKeyDistribution\
 
 [HIDPI]
